# 生成：2026-11-13，生成器 build_override.py；上游 https://yfamilys.com/stoverride/startingad.stoverride、https://github.com/BiliUniverse/ADBlock/releases/latest/download/BiliBili.ADBlock.stoverride
name: 去广告（秋风＋墨鱼去开屏＋B站）
desc: 秋风广告规则拦广告域名（Stash 每天自动更新）；墨鱼 APP 启动页去广告、B站去广告（每天自动从上游重新生成，本版 2026-11-13；已去掉来源无法核实的脚本）。
rule-providers:
  AWAvenue-Ads:
    behavior: classical
    format: yaml
    url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TG-Twilight/AWAvenue-Ads-Rule/main/Filters/AWAvenue-Ads-Rule-Clash-Classical.yaml
